@startuml 类图
title 类图：ORM 实体与 Agent 类

package "ORM 实体 (app/db.py)" {
  class User {
    +user_id : String
    +nickname : String
    +username : String
    +password_hash : String
    +body_shape : String
    +pref_color : int
    +pref_style : int
    +pref_comfort : int
    +pref_occasion : int
    +pref_fabric : int
  }
  class ClothingItem {
    +item_id : String
    +user_id : String
    +name : String
    +category : String
    +sub_category : String
    +color : String
    +warmth_level : int
    +formality_level : int
  }
  class ChatSession {
    +session_id : String
    +user_id : String
    +status : String
    +constraints : JSON
    +remaining_count : int
    +messages : List
  }
  class ChatMessage {
    +message_id : String
    +session_id : String
    +role : String
    +action : String
    +content : String
  }
  class FeedbackRecord {
    +record_id : String
    +user_id : String
    +rating : int
    +evidence : JSON
  }
  class PurchaseEvaluation {
    +evaluation_id : String
    +user_id : String
    +target_item : JSON
    +result : JSON
  }
  class OutfitRecord {
    +outfit_id : String
    +user_id : String
    +session_id : String
    +items : JSON
    +score : float
  }
}

ChatSession "1" o-- "0..*" ChatMessage : messages
User "1" --> "0..*" ClothingItem : 拥有
User "1" --> "0..*" ChatSession : 发起
ChatSession "1" --> "0..*" OutfitRecord : 产生
User "1" --> "0..*" FeedbackRecord : 提交
User "1" --> "0..*" PurchaseEvaluation : 发起

package "Agent (app/agent)" {
  class RecommendEngine {
    +recommend(ctx, items)
    +_hard_filter()
    +_score()
    +_diversify()
    +refine()
  }
  class RuleRepository {
    +filter_rules : list
    +score_rules : list
    +body_rules : dict
    +load()
  }
  class KnowledgeIndex {
    +chunks : list
    +bm25 : BM25
    +load()
    +search()
  }
  class LLMClient
  class GarmentProfile
}

RecommendEngine --> RuleRepository : 使用
RecommendEngine ..> GarmentProfile : 调用
KnowledgeIndex ..> LLMClient : 检索后生成

@enduml
